OL,3,GNEWSAOpen water swimming can be 'life's
OL,4,Agreatest reward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Jersey who gave up long
OL,7,Fdistance swimming for 30 years before
OL,8,Fcoming back to swim both the English
OL,9,FChannel and the North Channel has
OL,10,Fwritten a memoir of the experience.
OL,12,FGraeme Lowe gave up the sport at 13 but
OL,13,Freturned to it in his 40s and went on
OL,14,Fto complete some of the world's
OL,15,Fbest-known open water swims such as the
OL,16,FEnglish Channel, Catalina Channel,
OL,17,FRound Manhattan and the North Channel.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
