OL,3,GNEWSAOpen water swimming can be 'life's
OL,4,Agreatest reward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis new book called, A Life Well Swum,
OL,7,Fexplores the doubts and decisions that
OL,8,Fcome with the challenges and highlights
OL,9,Fthe teamwork, trust, and decisions
OL,10,Fduring the swims.
OL,12,FHe said the book became "more about
OL,13,Flife" than swimming and hoped it would
OL,14,Finspire others to take a dip.
